# Adjudication packs are the audit trail of every judgement call the company
# did not make on its own. They are written to be verified by someone who has
# only the repo, so they must actually be IN the repo -- a pack citing files a
# reviewer cannot open is how the 2026-07-29 packs both went out.
!docs/devops/decision-pack-*.md
!docs/devops/app-230-mcp-wiring.md
!docs/devops/app-250-crash-alarm.md
!docs/devops/env-ownership.md
!docs/devops/runbook-container-jcode-claude-agent.md
!docs/handoff.html
